<title>USA: Digital Biometrics seeks Identix judgment.</title>
<headline>Digital Biometrics seeks Identix judgment.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Biometrics Inc said Friday it filed a motion seeking a summary judgment in a patent infringement lawsuit against Identix Inc of Sunnyvale, Calif.</p>
<p>The motion was filed in U.S. District Court for the Northern District of California. Digital Biometrics claims the Identix Model TP-900 fingerprint capture system infringes claims of Digital's patented technology.</p>
<p>Digital Biometrics manufactures live-scan fingerprint technology.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
